   "communityToFollowers[i] lists the distinct follower ids \"F<j>\" following community \"C<i>\", and followerToCommunities[j] lists the distinct community ids \"C<i>\" followed by \"F<j>\"; the two lists describe the same relation (F<j> is in communityToFollowers[i] exactly when C<i> is in followerToCommunities[j]) and ids are written without leading zeros.",
